{"1200770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deathground", "steam_appid": 1200770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you’re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer to play solo or in a team of up to 4 players, your survival instincts will be put to the test and teamwork, stealth and strategy are key to getting out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tools, complete mission objectives and successfully extract whilst navigating the once-secure prehistoric-research compound, now overrun by deadly predators with a taste for blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a4b45d991c71b526fbdd17657ce894b5.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, hearing and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197cb26c2b.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197cb26c2b.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197cb26c2b.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7747360c63abe18fddaffbd947331878.avif?t=1778507378\" width=530 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players drop into each map to complete tense missions, recover lore documents and fight to escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers procedurally-generated elements, varied objectives and reactive enemies that keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators, and make it to extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/03b2a70ddfd0019691476bcb1f81ff39.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/03b2a70ddfd0019691476bcb1f81ff39.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/03b2a70ddfd0019691476bcb1f81ff39.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/3066e4ef305644255c55a19786448e73.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items, namely the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Field-Medkit, each offering tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a9634318ce0a1627f2d551c09d888c31.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leave your teammates behind for a more isolating horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter at your own risk - with no one to rely on, your wits and tools are your only lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/30a927cc9cc4e38b5c424804d1423c62.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between feathered and non-feathered dinosaurs to suit your own visual preference. Players can also mix and match styles in the same session - from a modern look to classic, scaly reptilian designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/3793ecb9b9ec73700cf44676a177aea5.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a range of abandoned and decaying research facilities, deep within the AEON compound, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. Can you navigate these anxious environments whilst your survival instincts are challenged at every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4b12778e2c88df95d5f8e356e1ba0bc9.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you’re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer to play solo or in a team of up to 4 players, your survival instincts will be put to the test and teamwork, stealth and strategy are key to getting out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tools, complete mission objectives and successfully extract whilst navigating the once-secure prehistoric-research compound, now overrun by deadly predators with a taste for blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a4b45d991c71b526fbdd17657ce894b5.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, hearing and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197cb26c2b.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197cb26c2b.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/10df23f4f844b54086839b197c