ifference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/bbed1e18bee56eff40748dac25448031.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a9634318ce0a1627f2d551c09d888c31.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leave your teammates behind for a more isolating horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter at your own risk - with no one to rely on, your wits and tools are your only lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/a1ec4665aa347a83bcbe033aaba0690a.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/30a927cc9cc4e38b5c424804d1423c62.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between feathered and non-feathered dinosaurs to suit your own visual preference. Players can also mix and match styles in the same session - from a modern look to classic, scaly reptilian designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/05eee12a36b945a5d43cea45482e011a.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/3793ecb9b9ec73700cf44676a177aea5.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a range of abandoned and decaying research facilities, deep within the AEON compound, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. Can you navigate these anxious environments whilst your survival instincts are challenged at every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.poster.avif?t=1778507378\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.webm?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/1a2fa32c25aa62676cfc006f8c692619.mp4?t=1778507378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4b12778e2c88df95d5f8e356e1ba0bc9.avif?t=1778507378\" width=512 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>", "short_description": "A 1-4 player co-op horror game that throws you into a desperate fight for survival against deadly dinosaurs. Run, hide and work together to complete missions and uncover the secrets buried within the abandoned AEON research facility. Can you and your friends make it out alive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/ab1101f4d933f3fa6a15439a217b7f24edfb43ac/header.jpg?t=1778507378", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/5705e9a80e5b48925ee95044e465b13cafe1897a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778507378", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/5705e9a80e5b48925ee95044e465b13cafe1897a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778507378", "website": "http://www.deathgroundgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8300H or AMD Ryzen 5 3550H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 